    "caption": "⚡️ In this event Sufyan will discuss about various ways to improve the overall user experience for better reading on mobile devices. Focus will be on successful applications that his team has developed, especially for comic book reading, overall usability features and other forms of reading in various scripts.\n⠀\nWho might be interested:\n🔸 Product Managers;\n🔸 Mobile App Developers;\n🔸 Рeople looking to add more accessibility to their mobile apps;\n🔸 UI/UX Designers.\n⠀\n❗️The event will be conducted in English with limited translations available in Russian. Registration form of the participants is at the link (taplink).",
